# What `pnpm run setup` fetches and builds beside the check, and the files SQLite keeps beside
# dev.db in the WAL mode ecto_sqlite3 opens it in (dev.db itself is ignored by examples/.gitignore).
# The schemas `prisma generate` writes in lib/shop are committed, to be read without running it.
/deps/
/_build/
/dev.db-shm
/dev.db-wal
